---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Terms of Service | Manage.Wedding",
      "url": "https://manage.wedding/terms",
      "description": "Terms of Service for Manage.Wedding. Review the guidelines, usage rights, calculation disclaimers, and terms governing our free wedding planning suite."
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms of Service | Manage.Wedding"
	description="Terms of Service for Manage.Wedding. Review usage conditions, calculation disclaimers, and user rights for our free wedding planning tools."
	schema={schema}
>
	<main style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(0.75rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); box-sizing: border-box;">
		
		<!-- Header -->
		<section class="section-paper" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center;">
			<div style="padding: 2.5rem 1rem;">
				<div class="tape" style="margin: 0 auto 1rem;"></div>
				<h1 class="font-heading" style="font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); color: var(--fg-pencil); line-height: 1.15; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
					Terms of Service
				</h1>
				<p class="font-body" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
					Last Updated: August 15, 2026 • Effective Date: January 1, 2026
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Main Terms Document -->
		<article class="hand-card" style="padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); background: #fff; line-height: 1.7; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
			
			<div style="background: #faf8f5; border: 2px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				<strong class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; text-align: center;">
					📜 Welcome to Manage.Wedding
				</strong>
				<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;">
					By accessing or using Manage.Wedding and its interactive calculators, estimators, templates, and export tools, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of the website.
				</p>
			</div>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					1. Permitted Use & Free License
				</h2>
				<p>
					Manage.Wedding grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use our web applications strictly for personal, non-commercial wedding planning, event coordination, and educational purposes.
				</p>
				<p>
					Wedding planners, event coordinators, and hospitality professionals may use our calculators to generate estimates and export Word/PDF documents for individual client consultations, provided our branding remains intact on exported templates.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					2. Calculator Estimates & Planning Disclaimers
				</h2>
				<p>
					All calculations, budget estimates, beverage calculations, timeline templates, tipping recommendations, and loan projections provided on Manage.Wedding are intended as <strong>general planning benchmarks and educational guides only</strong>:
				</p>
				<ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; list-style-type: square;">
					<li><strong>Alcohol & Catering Calculations:</strong> Beverage consumption depends on guest demographics, venue policies, and local liquor laws. Event hosts must verify final bar orders with licensed bartending professionals and venue managers.</li>
					<li><strong>Budget & Loan Figures:</strong> Interest rates, payment schedules, and vendor cost benchmarks fluctuate based on geography, credit profiles, and inflation. We do not provide formal banking or legal financial advice.</li>
					<li><strong>Dress Sizing & Rings:</strong> Sizing converters provide standardized approximations. Because bridal designers use proprietary size charts and fabrics stretch differently, professional alteration fittings are always required.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					3. User Content & Document Export Ownership
				</h2>
				<p>
					You retain 100% ownership of all content, guest lists, speeches, seating plans, custom vows, and financial figures that you input into Manage.Wedding.
				</p>
				<p>
					Any exported Word (.doc), PDF, or CSV documents generated through our platform belong entirely to you, and you may freely print, share, or edit them for your celebration.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					4. Intellectual Property
				</h2>
				<p>
					The design, layout, custom hand-drawn graphical styling, interactive algorithms, code, and editorial content on Manage.Wedding are the proprietary intellectual property of Manage.Wedding and protected by international copyright, trademark, and unfair competition laws.
				</p>
				<p>
					You may not scrape, mirror, reverse-engineer, or reproduce substantial portions of our site logic without prior written permission.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					5. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability
				</h2>
				<p>
					MANAGE.WEDDING IS PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. WE DO NOT GUARANTEE THAT THE SITE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, BUG-FREE, OR ERROR-FREE.
				</p>
				<p>
					IN NO EVENT SHALL MANAGE.WEDDING, ITS CREATORS, OR AFFILIATES BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR SPECIAL DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF YOUR USE OF THE TOOLS, EVENT PLANNING DECISIONS, OR VENDOR DISPUTES.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--fg-pencil); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
					6. Contact Information
				</h2>
				<p>
					If you have questions regarding these Terms of Service or legal inquiries, please contact:
				</p>
				<div style="background: var(--bg-paper); border: 1.5px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1rem; text-align: center;">
					<strong>Manage.Wedding Legal Department</strong><br />
					Email: <a href="mailto:legal@manage.wedding" style="color: var(--accent-blue);">legal@manage.wedding</a><br />
					Website: <a href="https://manage.wedding" style="color: var(--fg-pencil);">https://manage.wedding</a>
				</div>
			</section>

		</article>

	</main>
</Layout>
